      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The <b>sun burns</b>. The gnomes <i>hunt</i>.

    But the prey... I
    need them.

    I must be <b>silent</b>. I must <color=#ff0000>feed</color>.

    

    <b>2
    minutes</b>. As many as I can find. As many as I can catch. Use <i>sneak</i>
    to get close enough to attack.

    

    <b>I. Must. Feast.</b>

'
